# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Tran so nguyen: PHAI khop CPython tung chu so (cap nhat 2026-08-05).

Python co so nguyen VO HAN chu so, TokenVector chi co i32/i64. Truoc
2026-08-04, 'add'/'sub'/'mul' cua CIL quan vong IM LANG:
    fact(13) -> CPython 6227020800,          TokenVector 1932053504
    fact(20) -> CPython 2432902008176640000, TokenVector -2102132736
    2**31    -> CPython 2147483648,          TokenVector -2147483648  (AM!)
13! la mot phep tinh het suc binh thuong, va no da sai san.

Lich su ba buoc cua chinh file nay: (1) quan vong im lang; (2) 2026-08-04
dung add.ovf/mul.ovf -> nem OverflowException, on ao nhung van chua dung;
(3) 2026-08-05 hang so nguyen mac dinh la 'int' (vo han chu so, struct
TkvInt) -> tra ve DUNG ket qua nhu Python, ke ca 30! va 2**100. Ba con so
o tren gio deu khop."""


def fact(n: "i32") -> "str":
    r = 1
    i = 2
    while i <= n:
        r = r * i
        i = i + 1
    return str(r)


def pow2(n: "i32") -> "str":
    r = 1
    i = 0
    while i < n:
        r = r * 2
        i = i + 1
    return str(r)


def add_big(a: "i32") -> "str":
    x = 2147483647
    return str(x + a)
